{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e349f3cf1e9be0e7a207bfc48c0fdb974762bd1ba2bdf48dda08ef9fa0f63766", "ja": "（このみさんが帰省するというので、休日を利用して\n同行した。山口県の地酒や料理を堪能した……）", "zh": "（听说木实小姐要回老家，我便利用休假陪她一起去了。尽情享用了山口县的地方酒和美食……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "cffcd7b9c1d9b7ff0b495e0aaf24062f76138b46c97d2695808e0d2a15fc3563", "ja": "やっぱり地元のふぐ料理は一番ね。ふぐ刺し、唐揚げ、\nてっちり……最後の雑炊まで完食しちゃったわ。", "zh": "果然还是老家的河豚料理最棒了。河豚刺身、炸河豚、\n河豚火锅……连最后的泡饭我都吃得干干净净呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2042d5e9046253bc8f0c99367d0188adb00d5c232fbe70e37ece26e7b91cea77", "ja": "はい……。それにお酒も美味しくて。\nこのみさん、結構飲んでましたけど大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "是啊……而且酒也很好喝。\n不过，虽然木实小姐喝了不少，没事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "33c54516e3455c99abf4247e2cc0528a858b019a78c908d39e887590497ae62e", "ja": "もちろん♪　こうみえて、お酒は強い方なの。\n……それにしても、やっぱり地元はいいわね。", "zh": "当然啦♪别看我这样，我可是挺能喝的。\n……不过说真的，还是故乡好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "3bbde9a53fd213acc79dea0060128042d967cabf2590425e1de0eabb2d5bcf41", "ja": "今日一日、懐かしい場所をいろいろ見て回って、\n本当にリフレッシュになったわ♪", "zh": "今天一整天逛了好多令人怀念的地方，真的让人焕然一新呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "3e97c421b41a6cb7fbadc7165b9397f7b2d7b17e3c3e5b191a71b065e6a5d8fd", "ja": "でも、{$P$}は楽しんでくれた？\nなんだか私ばかり楽しんでるみたいで……。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生玩得开心吗？\n总觉得好像只有我一个人在享受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5865eb11200035b5adf3e1db61a3d00e2d2b95dc5bb521395c2c4cae24db1039", "ja": "そんなことないですよ。このみさんが案内してくれた\n場所は、どこも素敵でしたし、楽しかったです。", "zh": "没有这回事。木实小姐带我去的地方，每一处都很棒，我也玩得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1007_p", "source_sha256": "95ca9256b368ebec1eee0b867846dc7bab7fb8c6ed2d09ded7413c7abd5767b5", "ja": "このみさんが、地元を好きなのが伝わってきました。", "zh": "能感受到这个美对家乡的喜爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "e73f1353743c15082c53737af4a2dda2154e18f3061a2c7a928c88b9fea10d4f", "ja": "ふふ、ありがと。\n私の地元を気に入ってくれたみたいで嬉しいわ♪", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n你似乎喜欢上我的家乡了，我很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "82895619e1414eff5f76a5aae65a7c98f6b26c26020c117bbf3148994f836a2b", "ja": "……そうだ！　この後、もうちょっとだけ\n付き合ってもらってもいいかしら？", "zh": "……对了！待会儿能不能，\n再陪我一小会儿呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f110165a90af7b763155ab0be655d6251b52bf3ba26da2797ed781ea283d129e", "ja": "構いませんよ。どこか行きたい場所が？", "zh": "当然可以。您是想去什么地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "52b4a997fac08d2b25f537d308ae4654d369afebef600c86cc65ae9791a735d1", "ja": "ええ。近くに温泉街があるんだけど、この時間帯は\nライトアップされて、すっごく素敵なの。", "zh": "嗯，附近有一处温泉街，这个时间段会亮灯，特别漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "8947127ba181292b21577a6cba41a357750376eef3f2c20e302a74116ac828bd", "ja": "お酒が入ってるから温泉には入れないけど……\n酔い覚ましに、軽く散歩でもどうかなって。", "zh": "虽然喝了酒不能泡温泉……不过，去附近散散步醒醒酒，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1013_p", "source_sha256": "251e117dbe984fef333e611ee4134d3852b2999dccf1c893a2b821216fac3cac", "ja": "いいですね、行きましょう！\nもしかして、そこも思い出の場所ですか？", "zh": "好啊，我们走吧！\n难不成那里也是承载着回忆的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "6c5cd1ea7805fd19615598032dec1c04343e8c3a8f8e65e50dd04315770b3f3a", "ja": "そうね。学生の時、友達とよく行ってたの。\n景色が素敵だから、歩いてるだけでも楽しくて。", "zh": "是啊。学生时代，我经常和朋友一起去那里。因为景色很美，光是走走都觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "162bdc35ecb98abb361e8e72fe1aae0f2750412e3526fdfb7ea837d0553f8c35", "ja": "懐かしいなぁ……。いつか特別な人と一緒に来ようね、\nなんて約束したっけ。", "zh": "好怀念啊……以前还约定过，说以后要和特别的人一起来这里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c6fbb975c95cc6b337a3e369ece203d705295745694a00efd50506a3b244348a", "ja": "そうだったんですね。けど、いいんですか？\nそんな思い入れのある場所に行っても……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。不过，真的没关系吗？\n去那种饱含回忆的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "02b75a57589c8272832e3103fae7a3d0b65fd23d93b848a2ffe30c828ff93190", "ja": "もちろんよ！　この話をしたのだって、その……\n{$P$}のこと……。", "zh": "当然没问题啦！我提起这件事，也是因为……\n想跟{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "1e614c78b6ce3dcc275f7979ce008f3447bd0ecde6132ed1a9d53113af6470eb", "ja": "それとも……私と一緒じゃイヤ？", "zh": "还是说……不愿意和我一起？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1019_p", "source_sha256": "aeabe59457059a1e7a302fb479420b845bcf16e69e5d0265272fda85d6a332f3", "ja": "い、いえ！　光栄です！", "zh": "没、没有！我感到很荣幸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0474_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "c8232ef6c4f35df6f5db0d31241cbb2a820d42c06be76957178cfb8cbff2e929", "ja": "ふふ、よかった♪　それじゃしっかり案内するから\n付いてきて。大丈夫。このみお姉さんに任せなさい！", "zh": "呵呵，那就好♪ 那我会好好带路的，跟紧我。放心吧，交给这个可爱的姐姐我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
